I found this very old post indicating a known issue:<br><a href="https://code.google.com/archive/p/bullet/issues/325" class="postlink">https://code.google.com/archive/p/bullet/issues/325</a><br><br>Is there an update on this?<br><br>I've noticed btRigidBody has the variable m_updateRevision. If I call btRigidBody::setCollisionShape to force an increment, does that eliminate the need for adding/removing the rigidbody from the world, for all things including change of mass?<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=14224">BruceBanjo</a> — Wed Mar 09, 2022 8:16 pm</p><hr />
